    old='Tables S41 onward add the 4 November fixed-model false-alarm diagnosis and raw replay measurements; no model is refitted for these additions.'
    assert old in supp;supp=supp.replace(old,'Tables S41--S45 retain the 4 November fixed-model false-alarm diagnosis and raw replay measurements, without refits for those tables. Tables S46--S65 add the completed 5 November payload and disagreement investigation: 68 classifier fits and a separate no-new-fit rule evaluation. These are retrospective candidates, with zero evaluated attack activations of the rule.',1)
    additions=r'\clearpage\section{Post-observation payload and selective-reconciliation investigation}'+'\n\n'
