    additions+=st('repair_binary','Every binary predictor on the nonempty content-disjoint V subset.',['Content','Predictor','FP','FN','FPR','SQL recall','F1','BA'],data,[.15,.15,.06,.06,.12,.16,.15,.15],r'N=1,012, with 895 Normal and117 SQL. All rates, F1 and balanced accuracy are percentages. FP=Normal-to-SQL; FN=SQL-to-Normal. OOF group hashes and primary test hashes exclude identical normalized binary-training content. High scores do not isolate attack content from protocol/capture differences.')
